 , artists) or researchers with a doctorate.\n\nOrganisation: Canadian Cent
 re for Architecture with the Window Research Institute\nLocation: Montreal
 \, Canada. On site.\nAward: CAD 5\,000 per month for up to 3 months\, plus
  travel and visa support.\nDuration: 1 to 3 months between July and Octobe
 r 2027\n\nMore: https://www.cca.qc.ca/en/101525/cca-wri-research-fellowshi
 p-program?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
