DESCRIPTION:The Hong Kong International Film Festival\, one of Asia's oldes
 t film festivals\, is taking submissions for its 51st edition (16-29 March
  2027). Categories: feature films (60 minutes plus)\, short films (20-60 m
 inutes)\, documentary features and documentary shorts\, and the Short Film
  Competition (any genre\, including fiction\, documentary\, animation and 
 experimental\, under 20 minutes).\n\nOrganisation: Hong Kong International
  Film Festival Society (HKIFF)\nLocation: Hong Kong (festival 16-29 March 
 2027). Open internationally\; except Hong Kong productions\, films must no
 t have screened in Hong Kong before the festival.\nAward: EXCEPTION: NOT F
 UNDED (festival call). Selection for one of Asia's oldest film festivals a
 nd its competitions\; prize amounts not stated in the call. Entry fees fro
 m 4 November to 31 December 2026: Short Film Competition (under 20 minutes
 ) USD 50 / HKD 390\; all other categories USD 80 / HKD 624. Fee waiver for
  documentaries by directors holding a Hong Kong Permanent Identity Card. F
 ees non-refundable.\nDuration: Festival 16-29 March 2027.\n\nMore: https:/
 /www.hkiff.org.hk/society/CallForEntries/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.hkiff.org.hk/society/CallForEntries/?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Hong Kong (festival 16-29 March 2027). Open internationally\; exce
 pt Hong Kong productions\, films must not have screened in Hong Kong befor
 e the festival.
END:VEVENT
