SUMMARY:Deadline: Stichting Stokroos: Seed Grant\, Autumn 2026 round
DESCRIPTION:The Stokroos Seed Grant supports early-practice visual artists\
 , designers and craft practitioners in the Netherlands with an unrestricte
 d budget for a self-defined plan: EUR 5\,000 for individuals\, EUR 7\,500 
 for duos\, EUR 10\,000 for collectives. The plan must start at least 10 we
 eks after submission\, last no longer than a year\, and can take place any
 where in the world.\n\nOrganisation: Stichting Stokroos\nLocation: Applica
 nts must live and work in the Kingdom of the Netherlands (including its Ca
 ribbean parts) or Suriname for at least one year\; the funded plan itself 
 can take place anywhere in the world.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 for individuals\,
  EUR 7\,500 for duos\, EUR 10\,000 for collectives\, as an unrestricted co
 ntribution to a self-defined plan. No application fee.\nDuration: Funded p
 lan starts at least 10 weeks after submission and lasts up to one year\n\n
 More: https://stokroos.nl/en/grant-rules/seed-en/?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://stokroos.nl/en/grant-rules/seed-en/?utm_source=artificialnouvea
 ugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Applicants must live and work in the Kingdom of the Netherlands (i
 ncluding its Caribbean parts) or Suriname for at least one year\; the fund
 ed plan itself can take place anywhere in the world.
END:VEVENT
