 ngton\, New Zealand)
DESCRIPTION:WOW is the world's largest wearable-art competition\, culminati
 ng in a staged show in Wellington\, New Zealand\, with the 2027 awards nig
 ht on 17 September 2027. The Kinetic and Avant-garde sections regularly at
 tract technology-driven wearables\, making this a natural target for e-tex
 tile\, robotic and sensor-driven garment work.\n\nOrganisation: World of W
 earableArt\nLocation: Wellington\, New Zealand\; open to designers worldwi
 de. Finished garments must be shipped to New Zealand (regional drop-off wi
 ndows mid-March to mid-May 2027).\nAward: Over NZD 200\,000 in prizes acro
 ss 25 awards. Per the published 2026 prize schedule: Supreme WOW Award NZD
  30\,000\, runner-up NZD 15\,000\, section winners NZD 8\,000 each. No ent
 ry fee.\nDuration: Annual competition\; entries open November 2026\, award
 s night 17 September 2027 in Wellington.\n\nMore: https://www.worldofweara
 bleart.com/competition/key-dates-and-deadlines?utm_source=artificialnouvea
 ugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
