 e 2027
DESCRIPTION:Closes 11 Dec 2026 at 17:00 EST.\n\nThe Adirondack Experience m
 useum on Blue Mountain Lake offers four one-month artist residencies for J
 une\, July\, August and September 2027. Residents work publicly on their o
 wn practice a minimum of six hours a day (roughly 10:00-16:00) three days 
 a week in the museum's public areas\, and spend two days a week (Fridays a
 nd Saturdays\, 10:00-16:30) engaging visitors in the Art Lab makerspace.\n
 \nOrganisation: Adirondack Experience\, The Museum on Blue Mountain Lake (
 ADKX)\nLocation: Blue Mountain Lake\, New York\, USA. Open internationally
 \; non-US artists arrange their own visas.\nAward: USD 5\,000 stipend per 
 one-month residency\, plus USD 500 travel allowance\, USD 250 Art Lab mate
 rials allowance\, and free on-site housing with utilities\, wi-fi and laun
 dry included.\nDuration: One month: June\, July\, August or September 2027
  (four residencies awarded).\n\nMore: https://www.theadkx.org/adirondack-e
 xperience-artist-in-residence/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral
