SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 Istanbul time: IKSV Ortaklasa: EU-Turkiye Cultural P
 artnership Call for Proposals 2026
DESCRIPTION:Closes 18 Dec 2026 at 17:00 Istanbul time.\n\nThe Ortaklasa pro
 gramme\, run by the Istanbul Foundation for Culture and Arts (IKSV) with C
 ulture Action Europe under EU funding\, supports cultural cooperation proj
 ects between Turkiye and Europe that rethink cultural policies from the lo
 cal level up to international cooperation\, support cultural and artistic 
 production\, and develop fair cooperation.\n\nOrganisation: Istanbul Found
 ation for Culture and Arts (IKSV) with Culture Action Europe\, funded by t
 he European Commission\nLocation: Turkiye and EU member states or candidat
 e countries (Albania\, Bosnia and Herzegovina\, Iceland\, Montenegro\, Nor
 th Macedonia\, Kosovo\, Serbia). Lead applicant must be a culture-oriented
  CSO based in Turkiye.\nAward: EUR 60\,000 to 120\,000 per project (total 
 budget EUR 890\,000)\; grants cover 70 to 95 percent of eligible costs\, w
 ith a minimum 5 percent cash co-financing. Project duration 9 to 12 months
 .\nDuration: Projects start around 1 April 2027 (indicative)\; results ann
 ounced 16 March 2027.\n\nMore: https://ortaklasa.iksv.org/en/eu-turkiye-cu
 ltural-partnership-call/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
