 _source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Turkiye and EU member states or candidate countries (Albania\, Bos
 nia and Herzegovina\, Iceland\, Montenegro\, North Macedonia\, Kosovo\, Se
 rbia). Lead applicant must be a culture-oriented CSO based in Turkiye.
END:VEVENT
