 -artists-in-finland-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium
 =referral
LOCATION:Seven residencies across Finland: HIAP Suomenlinna (Helsinki)\, AA
 RK (Korpo\, Turku Archipelago)\, Art Centre Salmela (Mantyharju)\, Fairres
  (Porvoo)\, Nelimarkka Artist Residency (Alajarvi)\, Vartsila Art House (N
 orth Karelia) and Gjutars Artists House (Vantaa). Open to Ukrainian or Ukr
 aine-based artists.
END:VEVENT
